# The repo's own root CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md are SyberMem-written instances from
# dogfooding this tool (they inject the session protocol pointing at THIS repo's
# .sybermem/). They are local runtime config, not product docs. Root-anchored so
# the user-facing templates under packages/**/project-files/ and
# skills/**/project-files/ stay tracked.
/CLAUDE.md
/AGENTS.md

# Internal development artifacts, not part of the distributed package:
#  - docs/ holds superpowers plans/specs/BACKLOG, internal audits, improvement
#    plans, and an outdated zh/ doc backup — all scaffolding from building this
#    tool, not product documentation (that lives in the root README/INSTALL/etc).
#  - the root superpowers analysis note is unrelated to the shipped project.
#  - the repo's own .claude/settings.json is this checkout's local dev hook wiring
#    (machine-specific absolute paths); the user-facing template lives under
#    packages/**/project-files/.claude/settings.json.
/docs/
/superpowers-skill-design-analysis.md
/.claude/settings.json

# The repo's own SyberMem memory is a local runtime artifact of dogfooding this
# tool; it is not part of the distributed package. Anchored to the repo root so
# the shipped project-file templates under packages/**/project-files/.sybermem/
# and skills/**/project-files/.sybermem/ are NOT ignored.
/.sybermem/
